  "tagline": "Embedded time-series and relational database for microcontrollers, RTOS and edge AI devices.",
  "description": "ITTIA DB is an embedded database family from ITTIA in Bellevue, Washington, aimed at devices that need to store and analyse data locally. ITTIA DB targets Linux, Windows, Android, QNX and VxWorks with SQL, replication and time-series features, while ITTIA DB Lite fits on microcontrollers under FreeRTOS, Zephyr or bare metal. The company now positions the line around edge AI, with ITTIA Data Connect for moving device data upstream and analytics tooling on top. It is a specialist commercial product: useful when SQLite lacks time-series handling or real-time guarantees, but with a small public footprint and few independent references.",
